<Page
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  heading="Disclosure"
  description="bla5k’s affiliate and advertising disclosure."
  updated="July 2026"
>
  <p>
    Transparency matters to us. This page explains how <strong>bla5k</strong> is supported.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some of the outbound links on this Site are affiliate links. This means that, at no
    additional cost to you, we may earn a small commission if you click through and sign up
    for or purchase a product or service. We only list tools and websites we believe are
    genuinely useful, and a commission never changes where or how a tool is ranked.
  </p>

  <h2>Paid listings &amp; featured slots</h2>
  <p>
    Some listings on this Site are <strong>paid placements</strong>. An advertiser pays a
    monthly fee for a directory listing or a featured slot at the top of the Site (see our
    <a href="/advertise/">Advertise page</a>).
  </p>
  <p>
    Every paid placement is <strong>clearly labeled "Sponsored"</strong> with a visible badge
    on its card and tool page, and its outbound link carries <code>rel="sponsored"</code> so
    search engines treat it as advertising. Paid placements are never shown as editorial
    picks: the ★ star means Editor's pick and is <em>earned, not bought</em>.
  </p>
  <p>
    Paying for a placement <strong>never affects</strong> our reviews, ratings, or editorial
    coverage. We only accept placements that meet the same quality standards as the rest of
    the directory, and we may decline any ad we consider misleading or unsuitable.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We may also display advertising provided by third-party networks such as Google AdSense.
    Ads help keep this directory free to use. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
    for details on advertising cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
  <p>
    Listings are chosen on merit. Being an affiliate partner does not buy a better position
    in the directory, and many of the tools we feature have no affiliate relationship with
    us at all.
  </p>

  <h2>Related policies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> — how we collect and use data.</li>
    <li><a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a> — the rules governing your use of bla5k.</li>
    <li><a href="/dmca/">DMCA &amp; Copyright Policy</a> — copyright and takedown procedure.</li>
  </ul>
</Page>
